        "official_en_sha256": "c8cf302c05ee9fecb4df03bf5ac8e9e18ea3da9e714ecf6616eaf29500fb00a9"
      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "ああ。\r\nそれで城に戻ることもなく、\r\n付きっきりで母さんの看病を始めたんだ。",
        "official_en": "Yeah. He tended to Mom around the clock, without going back to the castle even once.",
        "real_en": null
      },
