      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "あのときソゼ皇帝はその女性と出かけてるんだ。\r\nどこに行ったのかわかるか？",
        "official_en": "And then he went some place with her. You know where to?",
        "real_en": null
      },
      "review": {
        "status": "KEEP"
