      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "あんたには感謝してるよ。\r\nこれでゾルダードも変わりそうだしね。",
        "official_en": "You know, I appreciate what you’re doing. It’ll be nice to finally see some change in Zoldaad.",
        "real_en": null
