      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "ソゼ皇帝の昔の女の話は\r\n城では禁句じゃしな。\r\n即位前は、駆け落ちの噂もあったからの。",
        "official_en": "The emperor’s amorous affair is a forbidden topic in the castle. Before he was coronated, there were even rumors he’d eloped.",
        "real_en": null
