        "set": "set-02",
        "namespace": "ST_ChrEv_0070_002_01",
        "key": "ChrEv_0070_002_01_006",
        "jp_record_id": "switch:locres:set-02:ST_ChrEv_0070_002_01:ChrEv_0070_002_01_006:c83f2d30",
        "official_en_record_id": "switch:locres:set-02:ST_ChrEv_0070_002_01:ChrEv_0070_002_01_006:c83f2d30",
        "jp_sha256": "9b815f87514a5cd639a9a6584da8104302a166bbd40d330aed7f54b5936cdf01",
        "official_en_sha256": "fc15adf57c22ce7e1de02b71d700d3a79799564be1f3c092717dddd7c889aca5"
      },
      "text": {
        "jp": "昔、ソゼ皇帝が極秘で城を離れたことがあった。\r\nそのことを知ってるか？",
        "official_en": "Years ago, he left the castle in secret for an extended period of time. Do you know what he was up to?",
        "real_en": "There was a time when Emperor Sozhe secretly left the castle. Do you know about that?"
